---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<Layout title={"Niranjana — Work"}>
<div style="min-height: 100vh; background: #f4f4f4; padding: clamp(0px, 3vw, 40px); box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #111111">
<div style="max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px); box-sizing: border-box">

<header style="position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 0; margin: 0 calc(-1 * clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px)); padding-left: clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px); padding-right: clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.06)">
<a href={`${base}`} style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; text-decoration: none; color: #111111">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600">NJ</span>
<span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Niranjana</span>
</a>
<nav aria-label="Primary" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; padding: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(244,244,244,0.55); backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.9)">
<a href={`${base}work/`} class="tab" aria-current="page" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; text-decoration: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.10), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1); border: 0.5px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.08)">Work</a>
<a href={`${base}projects/`} class="tab" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: #111111; text-decoration: none">Projects</a>
<a href={`${base}digital-twin/`} class="tab" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: #111111; text-decoration: none">Digital Twin</a>
</nav>
<a href={`${base}#contact`} style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #111111; text-decoration: none">Contact</a>
</header>

<section aria-labelledby="page-title" style="padding: 64px 0 40px">
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959; margin-bottom: 8px">Work</div>
<h1 id="page-title" style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 22ch">Products I have shipped, and the decisions behind them.</h1>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #595959; max-width: 60ch">Each case study follows the same shape: the problem, what I did, and what changed.</p>
<nav aria-label="Case studies" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px">


<a href="#nexus" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none">Nexus at Method</a>
<a href="#inflection" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none">Inflection.io</a><a href="#nyantrace" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none">NyanTrace.ai</a>
<a href="#teaching" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none">Teaching at NYU</a>
</nav>
</section><article id="nexus" aria-labelledby="nx-title" style="padding: 64px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 64px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px">
<img src={`${base}images/a9484fa46a35712b1c368ffa9ae91bd8.png`} alt="Nexus cover" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 4px; background: #ffffff">
</div>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">Method, a Hitachi Company · Jun – Aug 2025</div>
<h2 id="nx-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600">Nexus: finding anything the company knows</h2>
<dl style="margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px">
<dt style="color: #595959">Role</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Product Manager Intern</dd>
<dt style="color: #595959">Timeline</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Research to working MVP in 8 weeks</dd>
<dt style="color: #595959">Stack</dt><dd style="margin: 0">RAG, semantic search, Gemini, Firebase, Drive API</dd>
</dl>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 480px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px">
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">The problem</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px">Knowledge at a 300-person consultancy was scattered across Google Drive, Slack, Miro and Figma. Finding a past case study could take most of a working day.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">What I did</h3>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<li>Ran 15+ stakeholder interviews, two surveys and two co-creation workshops, and compared 15+ tools.</li>
<li>Wrote the PRD, including a content taxonomy and metadata for 300+ client case studies.</li>
<li>Designed permission-aware access, so search only returns what each person is allowed to see.</li>
<li>Built persona-based onboarding, a Jira backlog and a three-quarter roadmap.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 16px">
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600">&lt; 3 min</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">discovery time, down from 5–6 hours</div></div>
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600">600+ hrs</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">saved each week</div></div>
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600">300+</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">employees served</div></div>
</div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/nexus/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Read the full case study →</a>
</div>
</article><article id="inflection" aria-labelledby="in-title" style="padding: 64px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 64px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px">
<img src={`${base}images/3403ee5bb210263ce0e9da1f6ff2c9d2.png`} alt="Inflection.io cover" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px; background: #ffffff">
</div>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">Inflection.io · Aug 2022 – Aug 2024</div>
<h2 id="in-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600">From product engineer to PM in a B2B marketing platform</h2>
<dl style="margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px">
<dt style="color: #595959">Role</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Product Engineer, then Product Manager</dd>
<dt style="color: #595959">Worked with</dt><dd style="margin: 0">CEO, engineering, design, data science</dd>
<dt style="color: #595959">Product</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Product-led growth and marketing automation SaaS</dd>
</dl>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 480px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px">
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">The problem</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px">Marketers needed to test and personalize campaigns, and connect the tools they already used, without waiting on engineering.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">What I did</h3>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<li>Conceived and shipped A/B testing for email subject lines, content and send times.</li>
<li>Built an inbound webhook system supporting 25+ providers.</li>
<li>Made the data case for a new email validation vendor and won leadership over.</li>
<li>Led a generative AI "Next Best Action" engine, and narrowed its scope when hallucinations made it unsafe to ship wide.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 16px">
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600">+20%</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">open rates from A/B testing</div></div>
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600">&lt; 15 min</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">webhook setup, down from 2+ hours</div></div>
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600">35–40%</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">lower per-tenant validation cost</div></div>
</div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/inflection/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Read the full case study →</a>
</div>
</article><article id="nyantrace" aria-labelledby="nt-title" style="padding: 64px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 64px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<a href={`${base}case-studies/nyantrace/`} aria-label="NyanTrace case study" style="display: block; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px">
<img src={`${base}images/8aa651dc0ff35ffb3a41a55e255c3df3.jpg`} alt="NyanTrace cover" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 4px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #161c28 0%, #151723 100%)">
</a>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">NyanTrace.ai · Jan – Jun 2026</div>
<h2 id="nt-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600">Governance for AI agents</h2>
<dl style="margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px">
<dt style="color: #595959">Role</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Co-founder &amp; Chief Product Officer</dd>
<dt style="color: #595959">Team</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Three co-founders</dd>
<dt style="color: #595959">Recognition</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Semi-finalist, NYU Stern Entrepreneurship Challenge 2026</dd>
</dl>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 480px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px">
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">The problem</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px">AI is replacing the logic inside systems of record, not just layering on top of them. Agents can be technically correct and behaviorally wrong, and today teams have little way to see it, stop it, or prove what happened.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">What I did</h3>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<li>Wrote the MVP PRD and ran customer discovery with prospective buyers.</li>
<li>Defined the control plane: policy layers, human-in-the-loop approvals, a tool gateway with scoped permissions and global kill switches.</li>
<li>Scoped SOC 2-mapped audit trails with tamper-evident logs, and cost governance with per-workflow budgets and circuit breakers.</li>
<li>Integrated the SDK with Google ADK through a <code style="font-size: 13px; background: #fafafa; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px">@govern</code> decorator for budget and tool-call control.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Outcome</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px">Five discovery interviews and an enterprise buyer call shaped the MVP, surfaced an unprompted design-partner signal, and took NyanTrace into private beta.</p>
</div>
<div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/nyantrace/`} style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Read the full case study →</a>
</div>
</div>
</article>









<article id="teaching" aria-labelledby="te-title" style="padding: 64px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 64px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">NYU Tandon · May 2025 – May 2026</div>
<h2 id="te-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600">Teaching Global Innovation</h2>
<dl style="margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px">
<dt style="color: #595959">Role</dt><dd style="margin: 0">Graduate Teaching Assistant</dd>
<dt style="color: #595959">Students</dt><dd style="margin: 0">200+ graduate and undergraduate</dd>
</dl>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 480px; min-width: 0">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px">I support students as they apply innovation strategy frameworks to real cases from HBS, MIT Technology Review and Gartner. I revamped the course materials, grade assignments and mentor project teams.</p>
</div>
</article>

<section style="padding: 64px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px">Want the short version? Ask my digital twin.</p>
<a href={`${base}digital-twin/`} style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Open Digital Twin →</a>
</section>

<footer style="padding: 32px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Niranjana · Product Manager · New York, NY</footer>

</div>
</div>
</Layout>
